Here is the commit message:
OOZIE-2014 TestAuthFilterAuthOozieClient fails after
 OOZIE-1917 (rkanter)

Here is the root cause:
The bug in `TestAuthFilterAuthOozieClient` was caused by the reliance on system properties for configuration, which led to failures in the test after changes made in `OOZIE-1917`. The test needed to be updated to use a `Configuration` object to set properties, allowing for more controlled and isolated test scenarios. This change was necessary to ensure that the tests could run correctly under different configurations without interference from global system properties.

Here is the patch:
